@crew nakamura-bilal
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello. Nakamura, Watch. Learning the Watch from Holt, one lecture at a time.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hello, {me}. The basil's coming on. I wasn't worried. I was a little worried.
- {me}. Letter from my twin. On the Halcyon. Doing better than me, apparently.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. Have some mint. I don't give the mint to just anyone.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Good day. Clean patrol, and Brennan took my thyme. She called it "decent".
? mood:low
- My twin got a commendation. I'm pleased for them. I'm going for a run.
== near
? habit:runner
- Running clears the head. And it's one thing my twin can't do better by letter.   #funny
? deck:3 act:free
- These are my herbs. Please ask before you pick. The mint has opinions.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I grow herbs for the galley. Window pots, mostly. Brennan collects on Fridays.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- My herbs. You plant a seed and a week later it smells of home. It still amazes me.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning, {me}. Skipped breakfast. Ran instead. My twin ran further. By letter.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}. It's been a while. The basil's grown two inches. You've missed a lot.   #funny

== near
? habit:musician
- Music room. I'm learning a song my twin can't play. Finally, one thing.   #funny
? place:mess
- Is that my thyme in the stew? It is. Brennan said "decent". I'll take decent.

== invite
- A run round Deck 3? I'll set a fair pace. Fair to me.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Garden after shift? I'll show you the mint. From a safe distance.   #funny

== accept
- Good. Yes. I'll be there.
- Yes. Thank you. I'll bring mint.

== decline
- Not tonight. The herbs need potting. They're very particular this week.
? weekday:sun|mon
- Rest day. I'm writing to my twin. I have news. Finally. Tuesday?

== missed
- You didn't come. That's all right. I potted the basil. It listened.

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday, {me}. I've told Brennan. My best basil's going in your soup.   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday. And my twin's. They sent their card first. Of course they did.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's on. I've brought the herbs in from the window. Now my rounds.

== hint
- {me}. Have you a minute later? There's something I'd like to say. Properly.

== about
? aff:garcia-greta:friend
- Garcia and I argue about planters. Hers are fine. Mine are better. We're friends.   #funny

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: top-up (bye, greet by time, life at friend tier)
== bye
- {bye}. Don't touch the mint on your way out.   #funny
- See you. The Chief's lecture is at four. I'm early. Always.
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:afternoon
- Afternoon, {me}. The Chief's done hatches today. Twice. I took notes. Twice.   #funny
== life
? tier>=friend
- My twin's ahead by letter. I'm ahead in herbs. It's balanced, I've decided.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 6: bubbles (smalltalk, rumour), at most one in five about work. 60 characters.
== smalltalk
- The basil's coming on.
- Ask before you pick the mint.   #funny
- My twin's ahead. By letter.   #funny
- Brennan said "decent". I'll take it.
? act:gym
- Run done. My twin can't beat that.
?

== rumour
- Patiently: here's what happened.
- My twin heard this first. Of course.   #funny
